{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22881","headline":"闻李六景俭自河东令授唐邓行军司马以诗贺之 · 白居易","name":"闻李六景俭自河东令授唐邓行军司马以诗贺之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁能淮上静风波，闻道河东应此科。\n不独文词供奏记，定将谈笑解兵戈。\n泥埋劒戟终难久，水借蛟龙可在多。\n四十着绯军司马，男儿官职未蹉跎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22881.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22881","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}